{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792580636583,"sessionID":"ses_ea1de83daffetTStmPb5FvGcdC","part":{"partID":"prt_15e21ce97001Ky742fD5ISvu41","sessionID":"ses_ea1de83daffetTStmPb5FvGcdC","messageID":"msg_15e21c253001vXOdFRLCdG2gVM","type":"tool","id":"call_2935cd0c2f1f452fa3af6bbb","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_NAME.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_NAME.md, lines 1-1\n1: Personal Project Board (个人小项目看板) - local single-user kanban board","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_NAME.md, lines 1-1\n1: Personal Project Board (个人小项目看板) - local single-user kanban board"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_NAME.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792580636311,"end":1792580636583}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792580636583,"sessionID":"ses_ea1de83daffetTStmPb5FvGcdC","part":{"partID":"prt_15e21ce9a001mf98btoXbWCLG3","sessionID":"ses_ea1de83daffetTStmPb5FvGcdC","messageID":"msg_15e21c253001vXOdFRLCdG2gVM","type":"tool","id":"call_82e2522b90274a06961697b6","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_OBJECTIVE.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_OBJECTIVE.md, lines 1-1\n1: Deliver a localhost-only, single-user, Python-stdlib web application that persists named boards, user-named ordered columns and ordered cards (title + short description) in one SQLite file, treats a card's column membership as the card's state (no separate status field), supports column add/rename/reorder and card move/reorder, shows every column's full card list with per-column counts, and reads the whole structure back unchanged after a restart. P0 explicitly excludes accounts, collaboration, a separate status field, WIP limits, notifications, time reports and automation, and those concepts are rejected at the API boundary rather than merely omitted.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_OBJECTIVE.md, lines 1-1\n1: Deliver a localhost-only, single-user, Python-stdlib web application that persists named boards, user-named ordered columns and ordered cards (title + short description) in one SQLite file, treats a card's column membership as the card's state (no separate status field), supports column add/rename/reorder and card move/reorder, shows every column's full card list with per-column counts, and reads the whole structure back unchanged after a restart. P0 explicitly excludes accounts, collaboration, a separate status field, WIP limits, notifications, time reports and automation, and those concepts are rejected at the API boundary rather than merely omitted."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_OBJECTIVE.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792580636314,"end":1792580636583}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792580636584,"sessionID":"ses_ea1de83daffetTStmPb5FvGcdC","part":{"partID":"prt_15e21ce990016MPgVrRoXptFZB","sessionID":"ses_ea1de83daffetTStmPb5FvGcdC","messageID":"msg_15e21c253001vXOdFRLCdG2gVM","type":"tool","id":"call_1444f0a4bd3c411db59464ff","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_AUDIENCE.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_AUDIENCE.md, lines 1-1\n1: One person running a small personal project on their own machine (the board's only user), plus the engineer who implements and probes it. The user names the board, names the columns after their own workflow, writes cards with a title and a short description, moves cards between and inside columns, and reopens the app expecting the same board, column order and card order. The implementer needs an exact, dependency-free local contract they can code and assert against.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-minimax-batch-2026-10-21/personal-kanban/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/VIEW_AUDIENCE.md, lines 1-1\n1: One person running a small personal project on their own machine (the board's only user), plus the engineer who implements and probes it. The user names the board, names the columns after their own workflow, writes cards with a title and a short description, moves cards between and inside columns, and reopens the app expecting the same board, column order and card order. The implementer needs an exact, dependency-free local contract they can code and assert against."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"prov